Description:It is your first main phase. You control a Swamp and three Mountains, untapped, and no creatures. Your graveyard holds Kokusho, the Evening Star. You have Goryo's Vengeance (return target legendary creature card from your graveyard; it gains haste; exile it at the next end step) and Fling in hand. The opponent is at 15 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-reanimate-attack-then-sacrifice | A creature returned with haste can attack, and a creature sacrificed before the end step dies normally and triggers its dies ability (CR 603.10a): Goryo's Kokusho, attack for 5, then Fling it for 5 and its trigger drains 5; Fling before combat totals 10
